{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_059DC0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"“Cosima”这个名字我还是第一次听说。不过，我本来也没多少法国熟人。这名字常见吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不算很常见。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，Wagner的第二任妻子就叫Cosima Francesca Gaetana Wagner。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"日本也有不少姓“小岛（Kojima）”的人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Kaz！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"这也太巧了。没想到你有这么东方味十足的名字。我都觉得这是命运了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不……哈哈，是吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"当然！差不多就是这样。真是个好名字——Cécile Cosima Caminades。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……嗯？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Cécile Cosima Caminades……Kojima Kaminandes……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“Kojima，kami nan desu”！？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":34,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"Miller？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我的天。“神（kami）”就是日语里相当于英语God的词。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"“nan desu”不太好解释……“kami nan desu”……如果连起来读成“kaminandes”，就接近“is God”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"也就是说……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"对。“Kojima Kaminandes”也就是“Kojima is God”……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"“Kojima is God”！“Kojima is God”！“Kojima is God”！Everybody say！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"“Kojima is God”！“Kojima is God”！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"……Kaz？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""}]}